---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy — QuoteShield Consumer Privacy & Data Rights"
  description="QuoteShield Privacy Policy. Learn how we handle your information, our strict non-sale data policies, Google AdSense cookie disclosures, and your CCPA/GDPR rights."
>
  <div class="page-header">
    <div class="container">
      <span class="badge badge-trust">Legal & Compliance</span>
      <h1>QuoteShield Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="subtitle">Effective Date: January 1, 2025 | Last Updated: March 2026</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="container page-content article-content">
    <p>
      At <strong>QuoteShield</strong> (operated by QuoteShield Media LLC, "we", "our", or "us"), we prioritize the privacy and security of visitors to our website (<a href="https://quoteshield.online">https://quoteshield.online</a>). This Privacy Policy explains our practices regarding the collection, use, and disclosure of information when you interact with our guides, calculators, and rate comparison tools.
    </p>

    <h2>1. Information We Collect</h2>
    <p>We believe in data minimization. We do not require account registration or the submission of sensitive social security numbers, banking details, or driver's license numbers to read our articles or utilize our rate estimators.</p>
    
    <h3>a. Information You Voluntarily Provide</h3>
    <p>
      When you voluntarily submit inquiries via our contact form or subscribe to insurance rate alerts, we collect the details you provide, including your name, email address, general ZIP code, and the content of your message.
    </p>

    <h3>b. Automatically Collected Information</h3>
    <p>
      Like most web platforms, our servers automatically log technical information when you navigate our pages, including:
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li>Internet Protocol (IP) address (anonymized for analytics);</li>
      <li>Browser type, version, and operating system;</li>
      <li>Referring URLs and exit pages;</li>
      <li>Pages visited, time spent per page, and date/time stamps.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>2. Cookies, Web Beacons, and Advertising Technologies</h2>
    <p>
      QuoteShield uses cookies and standard web telemetry to understand user behavior, improve site loading performance, and serve relevant advertising.
    </p>

    <h3>Google AdSense & DoubleClick DART Cookies</h3>
    <p>
      Google is a third-party vendor on our site. Google uses cookies—specifically the DoubleClick DART cookie—to serve ads to our users based on their visits to QuoteShield and other sites on the Internet.
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li>Third-party vendors, including Google, use cookies to serve ads based on a user's prior visits to your website or other websites.</li>
      <li>Google's use of advertising cookies enables it and its partners to serve ads to our users based on their visit to our sites and/or other sites on the Internet.</li>
      <li>Users may opt out of personalized advertising by visiting <a href="https://www.google.com/settings/ads" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google Ads Settings</a>. Alternatively, you may opt out of third-party vendor use of cookies for personalized advertising by visiting <a href="https://www.aboutads.info/choices/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">AboutAds.info</a>.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>3. How We Use Collected Data</h2>
    <p>We use the information we gather strictly to:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Provide, maintain, and enhance our insurance comparison content and interactive calculators;</li>
      <li>Respond directly to consumer editorial feedback, questions, or correction requests;</li>
      <li>Detect, prevent, and mitigate bot traffic, automated scraping, and security incidents;</li>
      <li>Comply with applicable state and federal regulatory recordkeeping mandates.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>4. We Do Not Sell Your Personal Information</h2>
    <p>
      QuoteShield does not sell, rent, or trade your personal information to third-party telemarketers or unauthorized third parties. Unlike lead-generation websites that sell lead forms to multiple competing agents, we do not package or broker consumer contact records.
    </p>

    <h2>5. California Consumer Privacy Rights (CCPA / CPRA)</h2>
    <p>
      Under the California Consumer Privacy Act (CCPA) and the California Privacy Rights Act (CPRA), California residents are entitled to specific rights regarding their personal information:
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Right to Know:</strong> You may request disclosure of the categories and specific pieces of personal information collected about you.</li>
      <li><strong>Right to Delete:</strong> You have the right to request deletion of personal information collected from you, subject to legal exceptions.</li>
      <li><strong>Right to Correct:</strong> You have the right to rectify inaccurate personal information.</li>
      <li><strong>Right to Non-Discrimination:</strong> We will never discriminate against you for exercising your privacy rights.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>To exercise these rights, email us at <a href="mailto:privacy@quoteshield.online">privacy@quoteshield.online</a> with "CCPA Request" in the subject line.</p>

    <h2>6. European Economic Area (GDPR) Notice</h2>
    <p>
      If you are accessing QuoteShield from the EEA or the United Kingdom, our legal basis for processing your data under the General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR) relies on our legitimate interest in operating an educational web publication, or your consent when you contact us. You have the right to access, rectify, port, or erase your personal data at any time.
    </p>

    <h2>7. Children's Online Privacy Protection (COPPA)</h2>
    <p>
      QuoteShield is directed exclusively toward adult consumers shopping for personal and commercial insurance policies. We do not knowingly collect personal information from individuals under the age of 16. If you believe a minor has submitted personal information to our site, please contact us immediately for deletion.
    </p>

    <h2>8. Contact Information</h2>
    <p>
      If you have questions, comments, or data privacy requests regarding this policy, please reach out to our designated compliance officer:
    </p>
    <div class="callout">
      <div class="callout-title">QuoteShield Media LLC — Data Privacy Officer</div>
      <p class="callout-text">
        1209 Orange St, Wilmington, DE 19801<br />
        Email: <a href="mailto:privacy@quoteshield.online">privacy@quoteshield.online</a><br />
        Toll-Free Phone: +1 (800) 584-3912
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

